# tsc -b (project references) build output for vite.config.ts
# was previously emitted alongside the source (vite.config.js/.d.ts) and got
# committed by accident, which broke lint in CI ('__dirname' is not defined
# because ESLint's flat config doesn't apply Node globals to a compiled .js
# file living next to the .ts source). tsconfig.node.json now redirects
# emit to node_modules/.tsbuild-node, but keep these ignored as a safety net.
vite.config.js
vite.config.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

